{"2321890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swordeye", "steam_appid": 2321890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into brutal, skill‑based combat in this hardcore MMO where your skill with your blade is the only thing standing between you and a quick death. Compete to climb an expansive, interconnected, and persistent tower overflowing with monsters, traps, and treasure.  Each floor of the tower is a unique hand-crafted dungeon crawl with a variety of different enemies, trials, and traps, as well as the ever-present threat of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/e7921ef8347f1621de2374f420566029.avif?t=1785894825\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up with friends or engage as a lone warrior to face off against the dangers of the tower.  Compete to traverse massive interconnected dungeons filled with monsters, bosses, traps, and loot. Can you make it to the top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/f882f2e84ea2721868519f1a5ccd4f85.poster.avif?t=1785894825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/f882f2e84ea2721868519f1a5ccd4f85.webm?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/f882f2e84ea2721868519f1a5ccd4f85.mp4?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/b4f955012426262305469dfe25d58f71.avif?t=1785894825\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swordeye combines a hardcore 6-directional combat system including ripostes, feints, kicks, and combos with persistent massive multiplayer dungeons, loot, abilities, and a skill tree.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/c5cb6f5602ff58255fa35a9303e32ec5.poster.avif?t=1785894825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/c5cb6f5602ff58255fa35a9303e32ec5.webm?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/c5cb6f5602ff58255fa35a9303e32ec5.mp4?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/77f666d871d4fe281eef3e3808390966.avif?t=1785894825\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress you will unlock skills and abilities, craft potions, upgrade gear and customize your combat style as you strive to gain power and reach the top of the tower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/a103109f7ee720681df906cf9c3b82fc.poster.avif?t=1785894825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/a103109f7ee720681df906cf9c3b82fc.webm?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/a103109f7ee720681df906cf9c3b82fc.mp4?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/388c251b43b1125cf133b4c92cbd6681.avif?t=1785894825\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your loot to upgrade your sword and craft new gear. Level up, and unlock powerful new skills and abilities to use against your foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/b303ba50b907a92ab43e6bf18b2431c8.poster.avif?t=1785894825\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/b303ba50b907a92ab43e6bf18b2431c8.webm?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321890/extras/b303ba50b907a92ab43e6bf18b2431c8.mp4?t=1785894825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into brutal, skill‑based combat in this hardcore MMO where your skill with your blade is the only thing standing between you and a quick death. Compete to climb an expansive, interconnected, and persistent tower overflowing with monsters, traps, and treasure.  Each floor of the tower is a unique hand-crafted dungeon crawl with a variety of different enemies, trials, and traps, as well as the ever-present threat of other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn